Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.4\fsp20\fscy80\fs80\c&HECE8EA&\frz352.7\pos(1049.999,316.857)}瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很美味啊 姬蒲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你有烹飪的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我選擇了烹飪 機關會支援我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,選擇？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,機關支援的是天賜才能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,容不得選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一出生便決定了職責
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也不需要去找人生意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 多麼幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心對待千束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,取決於現場狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法保證
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再待那裡扮家家酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 這裡又不是酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大白天就喝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有啊 瑞希不就這麼喝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,阿部 我們還有任務呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的也好豪華
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是千束特製嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,北村也吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.05,0:01:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好 特製一份兩份三份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 特製三份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣下去要糟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,赤字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這還算上委託賺的錢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,子彈和交通費怎麼解決的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有DA的資金援助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,以千束Lycoris活動費的名目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,完全入不敷出啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因為她用那麼貴的子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:01:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那個帕菲也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,說是自立結果全靠DA救濟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼說話跟楠木一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以後我負責LycoReco的經營
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 叫清潔工開銷巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要破壞現場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,避免加劇修復工作的行動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,用太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,開著冰箱門浪費電
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,3 7
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,接得好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 完事就快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,報酬還沒給
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快給
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,想挨槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是我們打的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,誰讓你不給錢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,其實還有兩根沒剪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,之後請自便
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 我付錢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看見了嗎 我只開了一槍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.49,0:06:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,做的不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,被誇了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希 我想了新帕菲的配方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,做個看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,天氣轉冷吃點暖暖身子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,熱可可滿溢的帕菲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我想的新菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這是大…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不也挺好的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再追加三份
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.17,Top,,0,0,0,,千束 這是二號桌的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,三號桌好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯做事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太陽打西邊出來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,千束說太忙了讓我幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,這孩子評論裡沒見過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,新店員嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,幾歲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,還有好多單
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快端去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位顧客
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了 裡面請
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希來幫個忙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 茶館LycoReco
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,山岸醫生找你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,來體檢啊 不約好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 其實今天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,店裡太忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一個莫名其妙的東西突然火了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我盡早去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她說今天不來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好怪的新人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,練習1
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,貓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,貓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,喵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,貓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,裸絞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,裸絞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家千萬不要學她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.84,Top,,0,0,0,,不給糖就搗亂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡人手夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:08:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,分頭行動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要到處跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不給糖就搗亂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,萬聖節快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,萬聖節快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,萬聖節快樂 我是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想要瀧奈的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你還小嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好大一包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,千束姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這也給我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 是錢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,玩銀行遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是IT革命嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,挺便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,比胡桃都強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧了瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈大人去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,還有胡桃 剛才還在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,炒股？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,考慮和胡桃一起搞些投資
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,至於嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 山岸醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,體檢是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她明天能去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,麻煩您了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,組員的健康管理我也負責
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:54.80,Top,,0,0,0,,組員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘了去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,後藤叔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,千束去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她今天晚班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 請點單
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是千束的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 帕菲做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這帕菲還是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,察覺了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係 都那麼火了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,來 RoboLyco
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,端去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好 這就去沖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不是屎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我是山岸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,山岸醫生 我是瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,千束在店裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有 她沒去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,沒來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也不接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 我也去找找
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,響鈴了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,能接嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,沒去體檢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 突然有急事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我告訴山岸醫生晚點到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要注意健康啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,身體是革命的本錢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,對我們來說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拿槍指著人還說這？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,活人才能被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,保密
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,和你那心臟有關嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,保密
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,虎膽龍威啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡誰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,鮑威爾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,警察啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那種和麥克萊恩都沒見過面就直接搭檔的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然後在結局
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想煮點咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝不了苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,還有別的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有何貴幹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你還記得我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,向我噴口水的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再往前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想不起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那就敘敘舊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,電視塔事件
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,西邊怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,學生？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊也來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真島
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大時鐘下面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,衣帽間四人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,右邊商鋪收銀下面三人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,已殲滅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有 還有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真島
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快起爆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,別把人描述成怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,本來就是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想起來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 誰記得你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那為什麼做這些事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,既然有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就說明有很強的才能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,給大家帶來幸福的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的完全相反吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也是殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,別相提並論
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在好好幫人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為亞倫是促進和平的機關嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你不都留下了好結果嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想像金牌得主一樣感動世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是老好人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我說 亞倫可不是那樣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,無論怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我和吉叔已經約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是證明
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫機關的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,與你無關
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你和亞倫接觸了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你知道多少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想幹什麼就幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你我果然是同類人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他們支援我去雇殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫的人很純粹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至對我們的廝殺很滿意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你搭檔來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,電視塔的Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真島去你家了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉他了嗎 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睜睜看著他跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他也有這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他有什麼才能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯也能得到支援嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀 你愛人知道什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:21.17,Top,,0,0,0,,哎呀 胡桃睏了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是在哪撿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔肯定不會幫他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.15,0:18:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧老師
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我的電話要在三聲內應答
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果沒接便視為發生意外
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我會給你響一聲鈴然後馬上趕去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不願意就馬上接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說無論在哪都會趕到對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,然後 轉移去別的據點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我還是最喜歡那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我還會去做客的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真假 同居嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,還給我做飯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 開工了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是DA的槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,和這個一起收到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吉松氏給的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很寶貴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你夠了 回櫥裡睡覺去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天涼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 瀧奈來的時候還開著櫻花
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那之後
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔沒來過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這是幼兒園那時的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,給我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈最近大顯身手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望店面能維持下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡對你很重要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘了去體檢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不情願
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不是不情願
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,打針
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怕打針嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,被槍指著都不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,打針都躲不開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,電視塔的Lycoris居然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怕打針
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快點打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,打完了 打完了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,打完了 打完了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.61,0:21:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,最艱難的環節通過了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都那麼怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是有點痛 但是身體內進入異物更難受
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.70,0:21:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,山岸老師說只是維他命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.23,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,山岸醫生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我得小心對待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,千束還沒來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼慢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 瀧奈你去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這是你的錯 三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:02.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:07.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:42.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:48.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:02.36,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:07.70,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:42.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:48.24,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
